    <description>
Loco is a next-generation Windows automation platform that combines AI and visual programming.
Features Tasker-style component selection for easy flow creation without programming knowledge.

## Features
- Visual flow builder with drag-and-drop interface
- Natural language to automation conversion
- 100+ built-in components
- Secure sandbox execution
- Plugin system for extensibility
- Tasker-style profiles and tasks
- Multi-language support (100+ languages)

## Quick Start
After installation, run:
```
loco
```
Or use CLI:
```
loco quick timer 7:00 notify "Good morning!"
```
    </description>
    <summary>AI-powered automation platform with Tasker-style interface for Windows</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
## Version 0.0.1 (2025/08/14)
- Added Tasker-style component selector
